      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Welcome to Kukhnya Season 2, Episode 10. Max reflects on how everyone walks their own path in life, right up until Sasha's furious landlady knocks on the door and reveals that an overflowing tap has flooded the neighbor's freshly renovated apartment below.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "По которой ты идешь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "А кого-то туда.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "У каждого свой путь.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто это?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Наверное, хозяйка.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "А что, прятаться у меня зачем?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ну, любят, когда я мужиков вожу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
